tore_item_assets/steam/apps/3159900/extras/e64e4f62216c04284e2772dff08b386b.webp?t=1749199794\" width=620 height=50 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159900/extras/d68a6afe8f6f7a7dcd0399cf05378661.poster.avif?t=1749199794\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159900/extras/d68a6afe8f6f7a7dcd0399cf05378661.webm?t=1749199794\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159900/extras/d68a6afe8f6f7a7dcd0399cf05378661.mp4?t=1749199794\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>While the game is terrifying, the plot also incorporates a lot of funny moments, and we believe this will be a relaxing adventure! When encountering zombies, stay calm and use your humor to defuse the situation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159900/extras/61ef6f694e8a7f13ef1980feb2a528d0.webp?t=1749199794\" width=620 height=50 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159900/extras/4f4696055e1d0186ffd4680b9cb49be0.poster.avif?t=1749199794\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159900/extras/4f4696055e1d0186ffd4680b9cb49be0.webm?t=1749199794\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159900/extras/4f4696055e1d0186ffd4680b9cb49be0.mp4?t=1749199794\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>When you feel that the game cannot be completed in one go, we strongly recommend that you just give up on trying to be perfect!  It doesn't matter where the end of the mystery 